  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nFreestanding `#840`-style priced obstruction under [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898) at `(b,a,x)=(38,2,2)`. Companion **Q=9 partitioned independent dual** alphabet on `(2,7)/(3,6)/(4,5)` after the Q=8 independent / one-repeat / two-repeat / shared-dirt / three-repeat series.\n\n| Dual schedule | Covering pairs | Min R | Tariff @ X=0 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Partition `(2,7)` | 20512576 | **80** | **502** |\n| Partition `(3,6)` | 69370560 | 88 | 518 |\n| Partition `(4,5)` | 122561600 | 92 | 526 |\n\nExact covering min is **R=80** on `(2,7)`; tariff floor **502 > 436** (also above same-walk Q=9 floor 466). No undercut of the six-query endpoint; **no new kappa**.\n\n**Scoped obstruction / priced alphabet.** Leave-alone through [#2868](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2868) / [#2867](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2867) / [#2861](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2861) / [#2860](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2860) / [#2858](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2858) / [#2851](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2851) was not reopened.\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/independent-walks-9q/`.\nTip: `1e15ae28c15d56f7c61220564207d571972a33a4`.\n\nExact: partition min **R=80**; tariff floor **502**; no undercut of 436.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-9q/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/independent-walks-9q/verify.py --quick\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-9q/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-9q/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/independent-walks-9q\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_9Q_OBSTRUCTION partition_min_R=80 ... tariff_floor=502 ... no_undercut_partitioned_independent_walks_q9 ... no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_9Q_QUICK ...\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_PARTITIONED_WALKS_9Q ...\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_9Q_PACKAGE_TESTS ...\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/independent-walks-9q outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()`; `-O --quick` also passes.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest prior: [#2851](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2851) (Q=8 partitioned independent), [#2868](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2868) (three-repeat OQ2), [#2867](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2867). Freestanding Q=9 package path; no competing open PR at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / #2851 / #2868 / PR1898 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
